sequenceDiagram
    participant Routing as llm-d Routing Layer
    participant PredSvc as prediction-service<br/>80/TCP HTTP (LoadBalancer)
    participant PredServer as prediction-server<br/>8001/TCP HTTP
    participant TrainSvc as training-service<br/>8000/TCP HTTP (ClusterIP)
    participant PVC as PVC /models/<br/>(Persistent Storage)
    participant Prom as Prometheus

    Note over Routing,PVC: Flow 1: Training Data Ingestion & Model Training

    Routing->>TrainSvc: POST /add_training_data_bulk<br/>8000/TCP HTTP | No Auth<br/>Telemetry: KV cache %, queue depth,<br/>input tokens, prefix cache score
    TrainSvc->>TrainSvc: Accumulate in stratified buckets<br/>(by queue depth, KV cache %, prefix cache)
    Note over TrainSvc: Periodic retrain every<br/>LATENCY_RETRAINING_INTERVAL_SEC<br/>(min LATENCY_MIN_SAMPLES_FOR_RETRAIN samples)
    TrainSvc->>TrainSvc: Train XGBoost/LightGBM/BayesianRidge<br/>TTFT + TPOT models<br/>(optional: queue-gated ensemble → 4 sub-models)
    TrainSvc->>PVC: Save model files (joblib)<br/>ttft.joblib, tpot.joblib

    Note over Routing,PVC: Flow 2: Model Sync & Prediction Serving

    loop Every MODEL_SYNC_INTERVAL_SEC (default 10s)
        PredServer->>TrainSvc: GET /model/{name}/info<br/>8000/TCP HTTP | No Auth
        TrainSvc-->>PredServer: Model metadata (size, last_modified)
        alt Model changed (newer timestamp)
            PredServer->>TrainSvc: GET /model/{name}/download<br/>8000/TCP HTTP | No Auth
            TrainSvc-->>PredServer: Model file (joblib binary)
            PredServer->>PredServer: Validate with joblib.load()<br/>MD5 checksum comparison
            PredServer->>PredServer: Atomic pointer swap<br/>(lock-protected)
        end
    end

    Routing->>PredSvc: POST /predict/bulk/strict<br/>80/TCP HTTP | No Auth<br/>Features: kv_cache_perc, num_request_waiting,<br/>input_token_length, prefix_cache_score, ...
    PredSvc->>PredServer: Forward to 8001/TCP
    PredServer->>PredServer: Construct DataFrame from numpy arrays<br/>(bypass Pandas type inference)
    alt Queue-gated ensemble enabled
        PredServer->>PredServer: Route to queued/idle sub-model<br/>based on num_request_waiting
    end
    PredServer-->>PredSvc: ORJSONResponse<br/>{ttft_ms, tpot_ms}
    PredSvc-->>Routing: Latency predictions

    Note over Routing,PVC: Monitoring

    Prom->>TrainSvc: GET /metrics<br/>8000/TCP HTTP | No Auth
    TrainSvc-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics<br/>(coefficients, bucket counts, quantile scores)
